====================================================
  APEPTIDE - Next.js 15 Deployment Guide
====================================================

Source code: /opt/apeptide-source.tar.gz
Deployed at: /opt/apeptide

有两种部署方式：PM2（直接运行）和 Docker（容器化）。选择一种即可。

====================================================
  方式一：PM2 部署（主机直接运行）
====================================================

Prerequisites for a NEW server:
--------------------------------
1. Node.js >= 18.18 (recommended 20.x or 22.x)
   curl -fsSL https://deb.nodesource.com/setup_22.x | bash -
   apt-get install -y nodejs

2. PostgreSQL >= 14
   apt-get install -y postgresql postgresql-client
   systemctl start postgresql

3. PM2 (process manager)
   npm install -g pm2


Deployment Steps:
-----------------

1. Copy source tarball to new server:
   scp apeptide-source.tar.gz user@new-server:/opt/

2. Extract and set up:
   cd /opt
   tar xzf apeptide-source.tar.gz
   cd apeptide

3. Create database:
   su - postgres
   psql -c "CREATE USER apeptide WITH PASSWORD 'your_password';"
   psql -c "CREATE DATABASE ankpiptide OWNER apeptide;"
   psql -c "GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON DATABASE ankpiptide TO apeptide;"
   exit

4. Configure environment:
   cp .env.example .env
   # Edit .env with your database URL and other settings:
   # DATABASE_URL="postgresql://apeptide:your_password@localhost:5432/ankpiptide"
   # NEXT_PUBLIC_ALGOLIA_APP_ID=...
   # NEXT_PUBLIC_ALGOLIA_SEARCH_KEY=...
   # ALGOLIA_ADMIN_KEY=...
   # MAKE_WEBHOOK_URL=...
   # NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://your-domain.com

5. Install dependencies & build:
   npm install
   npx prisma generate
   npx prisma db push
   npm run build

Admin Panel:
   - URL: http://your-domain.com/admin/login
   - Default password: admin (change in .env: ADMIN_PASSWORD=your_secure_password)
   - Features: Dashboard, Product CRUD (create/read/update/delete)

6. Start with PM2:
   pm2 start npm --name "apeptide" -- run start -- -p 3000
   pm2 save
   pm2 startup   # enables auto-start on boot

7. (Optional) Nginx reverse proxy:
   apt-get install -y nginx
   # Create /etc/nginx/sites-available/apeptide:
   server {
       listen 80;
       server_name your-domain.com;

       location / {
           proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:3000;
           proxy_http_version 1.1;
           proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
           proxy_set_header Connection 'upgrade';
           proxy_set_header Host $host;
           proxy_cache_bypass $http_upgrade;
       }
   }
   ln -s /etc/nginx/sites-available/apeptide /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/
   systemctl restart nginx

8. (Optional) SSL with Let's Encrypt:
   apt-get install -y certbot python3-certbot-nginx
   certbot --nginx -d your-domain.com


====================================================
  方式二：Docker 部署（推荐）
====================================================

前提条件：Docker 和 Docker Compose

   apt-get install -y docker.io docker-compose-v2

部署步骤：

1. 复制源码到服务器：
   scp apeptide-source.tar.gz user@new-server:/opt/

2. 解压并进入目录：
   cd /opt
   tar xzf apeptide-source.tar.gz
   cd apeptide

3. 启动（自动构建镜像并启动 PostgreSQL + App）：
   docker compose up -d --build

4. 查看状态：
   docker compose ps
   docker compose logs app

5. 停止：
   docker compose down

环境变量配置在 docker-compose.yml 的 app.environment 中，按需修改。

====================================================
